ass=\"nu0\">100</span>, key<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'('</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> key <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\") \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>before <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span>after<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"equivalent to key (100)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>before<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"goes before key (100)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>after<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"goes after key (100)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/unreachable\"><span class=\"kw3651\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unreachable</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<